% SPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2
% =====================================================================
% parameters.clausal -- the PROVENANCE records of the sourced figures of
% sg/data_protection/pdpa_data_breach_notification. PROVENANCE ONLY: this file references each figure by
% name and holds no value, and the logic modules do not import it.
%
% If parameters-sources.yaml is the COMMISSIONING REGISTER (its first line
% says so), then for EACH of its keys:
%   1. the VALUE is a fact in the determination slice that READS it
%      (that slice's .clausal file), never here;
%   2. this file holds its provenance record, a fact:
%        parameter_source(<key>, [label-'...', ref-'...']).
%      with the verbatim pair OMITTED while the yaml entry is
%      `status: unverified`.
% Otherwise this file holds no records at the baseline.
%
% This domain's parameters-sources.yaml is the empty template, not a
% commissioning register, so this file holds no records. The statutory
% figures of the order are declared once, as constant_value/2, in the slice
% pdpa_data_breach_notification.clausal, and their provenance is carried by
% the citation records that state them:
%   - 500 affected individuals        sg_pdpa_2012_s64_2021_reg_4
%   - 3 calendar days                 sg_pdpa_2012_s26d_1
%   - 1 February 2021 (on or after)   sg_pdpa_2012_s26c_1
% =====================================================================

:- module(parameters, []).

:- end_module(parameters).
